{
  "_readme": [
    "Lab test catalogue used to read report tables (services/table_reader.py, services/test_names.py).",
    "To support a new spelling, add it to the test's 'aliases'. Aliases are compared with the WHOLE printed",
    "test name after normalisation (lower case; punctuation, brackets and footnote marks become spaces), never",
    "as a substring: 'Bilirubin' does not match 'Bilirubin Direct'. Unmatched names are logged and shown on the",
    "review screen; they are never guessed.",
    "units: printed unit (normalised by units.normalise_unit) -> multiplier to the canonical 'unit'. A unit not",
    "listed is rejected for that test. A value printed without a unit is taken to be in the canonical unit.",
    "plausible: [low, high] in the canonical unit. Outside it the value is treated as a likely misread",
    "(not a clinical judgement; the clinical flag uses the range printed on the report)."
  ],

  "headers": {
    "name": ["test", "tests", "test name", "test names", "name of test", "test description", "description",
             "examination", "examinations", "investigation", "investigations", "parameter", "parameters",
             "analyte", "component", "particulars", "test parameter"],
    "value": ["result", "results", "value", "values", "observed value", "observed values", "observation",
              "result value", "patient value", "your value", "test result", "observed"],
    "unit": ["unit", "units", "uom", "unit of measurement"],
    "range": ["reference range", "reference ranges", "normal range", "normal ranges", "ref range", "ref ranges",
              "reference", "reference interval", "reference intervals", "biological reference interval",
              "biological ref interval", "bio ref interval", "bio ref range", "biological reference range",
              "reference value", "reference values", "normal value", "normal values", "ref interval",
              "reference limits", "range", "expected values", "ref value", "ref values"],
    "flag": ["flag", "flags", "h l", "status"]
  },

  "ignore_tokens": ["serum", "s", "plasma", "edta", "fluoride", "whole", "blood", "venous", "capillary", "sample",
                    "calculated", "calc", "ise", "kinetic", "enzymatic", "ifcc", "jaffe", "urease", "god", "pod",
                    "hexokinase", "colorimetric", "photometric", "automated", "auto", "method", "impedance",
